WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520
After a flood, a truck
reaches a village with food,

2
00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.910
clean water and blankets.

3
00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:09.240
On its side is the name
of a Christian charity.

4
00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:13.200
Inside, there are no
sermons, only supplies.

5
00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:17.200
Some people say that is exactly
how Christians should help.

6
00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.790
Others say something is missing.

7
00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:23.970
So if a charity feeds the
hungry but never mentions God,

8
00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:26.590
is it still doing Christian work?

9
00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:31.290
In this mission, you'll meet a Greek word
for a love that gives and expects nothing

10
00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:32.330
back.

11
00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:37.430
Then you'll hear a story Jesus told about
a stranger lying hurt beside a dangerous

12
00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:38.530
road.

13
00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:43.550
Your mission: find out how Christians
judge aid that never mentions God.
